Activation functions:

1. Sigmoid
    1.1. It is used for binary classifier
    1.2. It works based on probability.
    1.3. So 0.7 means chances of true is 70% and false is 30%.
    1.4. It uses the loss function called BinaryCrossEntrophy.

2. Softmax
    2.1. It is used for multi classifiers.
    2.2. It works based on classes.
    2.3. Classes means number of output in the classifier.
    2.4. It uses the loss function called CategoricalCrossEntrophy.
 
 3. Optimizer
    3.1. Adam (basics) - smaller ANN
    3.2. SGD - CNN
    3.3. SGD with momentum - CNN
    3.4. Adagrad - Transformers
    3.5. Adadelta - LLM, LM/NLP
    3.6. RMSP ROP - LLM, LM/NLP